      "text": "The plan from step 2, roughly:\nwave 1, at the same time:\n  knowledge.search(\"return policy\")\n  orders.find(customer, \"jacket\", \"last week\")\nwave 2, after wave 1:\n  inventory.check(product_id from orders, \"M\")",
